  "content": "<media-image source=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/haxtheweb/art/main/haxtheweb/hax-morph/media/hax-morph.gif\" alt=\"Pixel text reads HAX, then breaks apart into rainbow pixel blocks, scanline tears and streams of ones and zeros with rpg-characters flashing through the static, rebuilding as Headless Authoring Experience, back to HAX, then Human, Agent, Experience, with the H, A and X lit in teal.\"></media-image>\n<p>HAX decays into Headless Authoring Experience, back to HAX, then into Human, Agent, Experience. Every transition breaks down into pixel blocks and bit noise, with rpg-characters thrown into the static.</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://github.com/haxtheweb/art/tree/main/haxtheweb/hax-morph\">Files, alt text and credits on GitHub</a></li></ul>"
